  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Ukriane multi-sector study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promote economic development in the Central-Ukrainian regions and oblasts, specifically Khmelnytskyi, Zhytomyr, Vinnytsia, Cherkasy, Kyiv, Kyrovograd, and Chernigiv. This goal will be achieved by attracting Dutch companies to invest in Central Ukraine and aid in developing the private sector in the area. One of the ways to accomplish this is through B2B connections and introducing new Dutch expertise to improve the business and investment climate in the oblasts.</narrative>
  </description>
